  "content": "\n\n# <img src=\"https://cdn-raw.modrinth.com/data/6uJCfiCH/0b4983e0ba8cac6ffe2cc5c2076a8a6b0b28fd1f.png\" alt=\"Spooklementary_logo\" width=\"60\" height=\"auto\" /> &nbsp; Spooklementary\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/discord-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=rgb(210%2C%20106%2C%206)&label=加入&labelColor=rgb(4%2C%2011%2C%2020)&color=rgb(210%2C%20106%2C%206)\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/iris%2C%20optifine%2C%20oculus%20%7C%201.7.10%20to%20Latest-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=支持&labelColor=rgb(4%2C%2011%2C%2020)&color=rgb(210%2C%20106%2C%206)\">\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=rgb(210%2C%20106%2C%206)&label=支持&labelColor=rgb(4%2C%2011%2C%2020)&color=rgb(210%2C%20106%2C%206)&link=https%3A%2F%2Fpatreon.com%2Fspaceagle17\">\n</a>\n\n## Spooklementary 是什么？\n\n* Spooklementary 由 SpacEagle17 制作，是基于 EminGT 的 [Complementary Shaders](https://www.complementary.dev/) 修改而成的版本。 \n* 这是一款以恐怖为主题的着色包（Shaderpack），能将你的游戏体验转变为充满氛围感与惊悚感的旅程。\n* 非常适合万圣节或恐怖地图！点击页面顶部的“Gallery”（画廊）查看截图。\n\n**重要提示：使用此附加组件时出现的任何问题，请不要向 Emin 反馈，而是请通过 [Discord](https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X) 向我反馈。**\n\n## 链接\n<center>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f94a4d0b4854a694e1b3dbb5aa8e42fc15bce89.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" />\n    <br><br>\n  </a>\n</div>\n</center>\n\n* SpacEagle17 的 **[<ins>Discord</ins>](https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X)** 服务器，用于讨论、提问、建议等……\n* 在 **[<ins>Twitter/X</ins>](https://twitter.com/SpacEagle17)** 上关注 SpacEagle17，获取关于该着色包的最新消息\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:655px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CndrX1R5boQ\" width=\"455\" height=\"384\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n\n## 赞助方：Ember Host\n正在寻找性价比高且可靠的 Minecraft 服务器主机？Ember Host 提供极具竞争力的价格与顶级技术支持！\n\n点击横幅或在结账时使用代码 **[EUPHORIA](https://www.euphoriapatches.com/ember-referral)**，首单可享 **10%** 折扣。此外，您的消费中将有 **70%** 用于支持 Euphoria Patches！\n\n<a href=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/ember-referral\"><img src=https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/545bcc6a4800cae3bace3a58a06e0dab9eccf9e4_0.webp></a>",
